bookerbob scenario fixtures
PASS  S1  prove: code derives the predicates, the verdict reveals a subset, the commitment opens  (revealed 3 of 4)
PASS  S2  bids: every merchant commits a sealed schedule, then reveals it after the deadline  (3 committed, 3 opened)
PASS  S3  verdict: signature checked on chain, one agent per person, nullifier pending  (ed25519_verify, attest_human)
PASS  S4  cheat refused: 'guest is marriott platinum' gets a signed refusal and no payment  (F9 not in proof set; winner m01.bookerbob.testnet)
PASS  S5  settle: the receipt price leaves escrow, the nullifier is spent, USDC goes to the merchant  (paid 38400000 to m01.bookerbob.testnet)
PASS  S6  replay: a second verdict for the same account from another wallet is refused  (nullifier spent)
PASS  S7  sealed reviews: 6 buyers who paid join, rate with Semaphore proofs, reveal after the round, released at k >= 5  (score 3.45, 6 ratings, no rater named)
PASS  S8  multi-hop rank: a hired sub-agent ring gets at most w/(1-w) of the merchant's seed  (5.999990 of 6.000000 units (bound 6.000000))
PASS  scenario: prove, bids, verdict, cheat refused, settle, replay refused, sealed reviews, multi-hop rank (8 stages, one chain)
